# === Transient agent artifacts — never commit ===
# Plans / QA reports / findings / audits / repros / evidence.
# Home for these is .hermes/ (ignored above); these patterns are a safety
# net for any that get written outside it.
/qa-*-plan.md
/QA-*-REPORT-*.md
/ERROR_STATE_*.md
/docs/fc-*.md
/docs/audit-*.md
/docs/qa/
/verification/*
!/verification/cdp_probe.mjs
/.screenshots/
**/.evidence/
/.worktrees/

# Playwright evidence capture output
e2e/capture/
